{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-014",
    "title": "第二盏灯"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_073",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "守灯人把完整的引路灯递给陆照临：“第二盏灯照活人。你若点亮它，镇上所有仍活着的人都会看见自己忘掉的东西。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第四声敲击之后，镇子重新安静下来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2116,
          "end": 2116
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "客舍外的脚印没有继续靠近，也没有离开。它停在门槛前，像一个守规矩的客人，等屋里的人先开口。白发老妇坐在墙角，双手交叠在木杖上，嘴唇紧抿，不再回答任何问题。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2118,
          "end": 2118
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把小灯盏放在桌下，用衣布盖住。他不敢点灯，也不敢触碰墙上那条不断延伸的青线。顾长离则守在门边，铜针尖端对着门缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2120,
          "end": 2120
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你说有人回来过。”陆照临压低声音，“是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2122,
          "end": 2122
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇闭着眼：“我说过吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2124,
          "end": 2124
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“说过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2126,
          "end": 2126
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就是我记错了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2128,
          "end": 2128
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向墙上山水画：“这里的人都会记错？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2130,
          "end": 2130
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇睁开眼：“记错比记得安全。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2132,
          "end": 2132
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外忽然响起一阵轻刮声，像湿手指沿着门板慢慢划过。陆照临掌心残印一凉，墙上的青线立刻停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2134,
          "end": 2134
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它来了。”老妇说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2136,
          "end": 2136
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2138,
          "end": 2138
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们不该跟随的引路人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2140,
          "end": 2140
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门缝下的影子没有脚，却一点点漫进屋里。影子先是细长的一条，随后分成三股，分别指向陆照临、顾长离和桌下的小灯盏。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2142,
          "end": 2142
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离甩出铜针。铜针穿过影子，钉在门槛上，影子随即缩回门外。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2144,
          "end": 2144
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只能挡一会儿。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2146,
          "end": 2146
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“去哪里？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2148,
          "end": 2148
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇指向客舍后墙：“后面有一间旧屋，三年前那三个人住过。屋里没有灯，影子不敢进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2150,
          "end": 2150
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是说镇里没有井？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2152,
          "end": 2152
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我没说没有屋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2154,
          "end": 2154
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们从后窗翻出客舍。雨已经停了，街上却比下雨时更湿，屋檐和石板都泛着一层青光。镇民家门紧闭，门缝里塞着灰泥，有些门板上画着半盏灯，有些则把灯纹全部刮掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2156,
          "end": 2156
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "旧屋在镇子最深处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2158,
          "end": 2158
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "屋门歪斜，门楣刻着“借宿”二字。顾长离推门时，门轴发出一声长响。屋内只有一张木床和三只空碗，墙上钉着一幅破旧的路线图。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2160,
          "end": 2160
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "路线图从玄霄宗开始，途经旧驿道，最后停在一处被黑墨涂掉的地点。图旁写着三个人名，前两个只剩姓氏，第三个完整可辨：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2162,
          "end": 2162
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临走近墙面，呼吸变得急促。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2164,
          "end": 2164
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你父亲的字？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2166,
          "end": 2166
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我见过他的灯账，不记得字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2168,
          "end": 2168
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你又忘了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2170,
          "end": 2170
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。他伸手靠近路线图，掌心青痕立即浮起。图上被涂黑的地点渗出水迹，黑墨顺着纸纹向下流，露出两个字：归井。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2172,
          "end": 2172
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来脚步。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2174,
          "end": 2174
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是影子的刮擦，而是真正的脚步。有人踩过街上的积水，停在旧屋前。随后，一个沙哑的声音响起：“屋里有人吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2176,
          "end": 2176
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把路线图揭下，卷进袖中。陆照临将三只空碗扣在桌上，假装他们只是借宿的过客。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2178,
          "end": 2178
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得姓。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2204,
          "end": 2204
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“姓什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2206,
          "end": 2206
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个姓陆，一个姓顾，还有一个姓叶。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2208,
          "end": 2208
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的脸色骤然发白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2210,
          "end": 2210
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2212,
          "end": 2212
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人摇头：“我不认识顾氏。我只知道那个姓顾的人，临走前把一枚铜环交给了镇里的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2214,
          "end": 2214
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“交给谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2216,
          "end": 2216
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“交给一个没有名字的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2218,
          "end": 2218
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "屋外的影子忽然撞上门板。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2220,
          "end": 2220
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人立刻闭嘴，将篮子塞进顾长离怀里：“别让它拿走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2222,
          "end": 2222
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它是什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2224,
          "end": 2224
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“忘记名字之后留下的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2226,
          "end": 2226
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影子撞门第二次。门框裂开一道细缝，青光从缝中流进来。陆照临把普通引路灯抱在胸前，灯罩内的缺口与墙上路线图重合。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2228,
          "end": 2228
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他没有点灯，灯却自行发出极低的嗡鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2230,
          "end": 2230
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人退到墙角：“不该亮的灯，不能在这里亮。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2232,
          "end": 2232
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门板在这时彻底裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2238,
          "end": 2238
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不退。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-084",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2282,
          "end": 2282
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“父亲？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2362,
          "end": 2362
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人没有回答：“三年前，他们来到无灯镇，问有没有人见过一条不会熄灭的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2364,
          "end": 2364
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你见过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2366,
          "end": 2366
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我见过路，也见过路上的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2368,
          "end": 2368
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们去了哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2370,
          "end": 2370
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人抬起蒙眼的脸：“你们只问去了哪里，不问他们为什么要走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2372,
          "end": 2372
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离说：“因为有人在追他们。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2374,
          "end": 2374
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2376,
          "end": 2376
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2378,
          "end": 2378
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人摇头：“追他们的是忘记他们的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2380,
          "end": 2380
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "仓房外忽然传来一声空灯撞击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2382,
          "end": 2382
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守灯人把完整的引路灯递给陆照临：“第二盏灯照活人。你若点亮它，镇上所有仍活着的人都会看见自己忘掉的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2384,
          "end": 2384
        }
      }
    ],
